","speaker1_x":555.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":1741.0,"speaker2_y":802.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":1318.0,"speaker3_y":503.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":926.0,"obj1_y":421.0,"obj1_w":331.0,"obj1_h":401.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":3.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"sValeriusEnerver","obj1_name":"sMasqueForetDesVoleur","obj2_name":""},{"speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Soldat : Mes hommes ont récemment découvert que dans un village à l'ouest, un des sous-chef de Gorrak, un homme cruel nommé James la Calamité s'y cache et prépare une attaque d'envergure. Si nous intervenons rapidemment, nous pourrions le capturer et obtenir des information sur Gorrak.","speaker1_x":555.0,"speaker1_y":542.0,"speaker1_w":365.0,"speaker1_h":567.0,"speaker2_x":1741.0,"speaker2_y":802.0,"speaker2_w":384.0,"speaker2_h":569.0,"speaker3_x":1318.0,"speaker3_y":503.0,"speaker3_w":420.0,"speaker3_h":640.0,"obj1_x":926.0,"obj1_y":421.0,"obj1_w":331.0,"obj1_h":401.0,"obj2_x":1017.0,"obj2_y":253.0,"obj2_w":300.0,"obj2_h":300.0,"textbox_x":1012.0,"textbox_y":966.39999999999998,"portrait1_effect":"Aucune","portrait2_effect":"Aucune","portrait3_effect":"Aucune","obj1_effect":"Aucune","obj2_effect":"Aucune","text_effect":"Aucune","speaker":3.0,"portrait1_name":"sKaelen","portrait2_name":"","portrait3_name":"sValerius","obj1_name":"sMasqueForetDesVoleur","obj2_name":""},{"speaker1_flip":false,"speaker2_flip":false,"speaker3_flip":true,"obj1_flip":false,"obj2_flip":false,"wait_after_ms":2000.0,"text":"Soldat : L'expédition sera risquée, nous avon